WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Every product starts with an idea.
Make yours real.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Meet Vukem.
A Go framework for APIs and full-stack apps.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Your next idea? Personal finance.
A real SaaS scaffold. Ready to explore.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Start with a command.
vukem new money --example finance

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Create the database.
cd money vukem migrate vukem serve

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Make it personal.
Registration and sign-in, included.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:56.000
See the whole picture.
Income. Expenses. Balance.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:04.000
Bring your data to life.
Six months of financial activity.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:12.000
Every detail counts.
Record and organize your transactions.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:20.000
A place for every account.
Your product. Your structure.

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:28.000
Go on the server. React in the browser.
Connected through Inertia.

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:36.000
Read it. Change it. Make it yours.
Generated application code belongs to you.

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:44.000
From an idea to an application.
Built with Vukem.

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:52.000
Your next product starts here.
Explore the framework. Build something new.

00:01:52.000 --> 00:02:00.000
vukem.dev
Create your first application.
